{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-1","title":"Mark 13:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Christ foretells the destruction of the temple; 9 the persecutions for the gospel; 10 that the gospel must be preached to all nations; 14 that great calamities shall happen to the Jews; 24 and the manner of his coming to judgment; 32 the hour whereof being known to none, every man is to watch and pray, that we be not found unprovided, when he comes to each one particularly by death.</p>\n<p>as he. Mt 24:1,2; Lu 21:5-7 out. Eze 7:20-22; 8:6; 10:4,19; 11:22,23; Mal 3:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-2","title":"Mark 13:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>there. 1Ki 9:7,8; 2Ch 7:20,21; Jer 26:18; Mic 3:12; Mt 24:2; Lu 19:41-44 Lu 21:6; Ac 6:14; Re 11:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-3","title":"Mark 13:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>as. Mt 24:3 Peter. 1:16-19; 5:37; 9:2; 10:35; 14:33; Joh 1:40,41 privately. 4:34; Mt 13:10,36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-4","title":"Mark 13:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Da 12:6,8; Mt 24:3; Lu 21:7; Joh 21:21,22; Ac 1:6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-5","title":"Mark 13:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Take. Jer 29:8; Mt 24:4,5; Lu 21:8; 1Co 15:33; Eph 5:6; Col 2:8; 2Th 2:3 1Jo 4:1; Re 20:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-6","title":"Mark 13:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>many. 22; Jer 14:14; 23:21-25; Joh 5:43; 1Jo 4:1 and shall. 22; Mt 24:5,11,23,24; Ac 5:36-39</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-7","title":"Mark 13:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>when. Ps 27:3; 46:1-3; 112:7; Pr 3:25; Isa 8:12; Jer 4:19-21; 51:46 Mt 24:6,7; Lu 21:9-11; Joh 14:1,27 must. 2Sa 14:14; Mt 18:7; Ac 17:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-8","title":"Mark 13:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>nation shalt. 2Ch 15:6; Isa 19:2; Jer 25:32; Hag 2:22; Zec 14:13; Re 6:4 famines. Ac 11:28 these. Mt 24:8 sorrows.\"The word in the original importeth the pains of a woman in travail.\"</p>\n<p>Ps 48:6; Isa 37:3; Jer 4:31; 6:24; 13:21; 22:23; 49:24; 50:43 Mic 4:9,10; 1Th 5:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-9","title":"Mark 13:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>take. 5; Mt 10:17,18; 23:34-37; 24:9,10; Lu 21:16-18; Joh 15:20; 16:2 Ac 4:1-21; 5:17-40; 6:11-15; 7:54-60; 8:1-3; 9:1,2,13,14,16 Ac 12:1-3; 16:20-24; 21:11,31-40; 22:19,20; 23:1,2; 24:1-9 Ac 25:1-26:32; 1Co 4:9-13; 2Co 11:23-27; Php 1:29; 2Th 1:5 Re 1:9; 2:10,13; 6:9-11 councils.[Sunedria,] Sanhedrins, the grand national council, and smaller courts of judicature in each city: see on Mt 5:22. For the fulfilment of these predictions, see Note on Mt ch. 24.</p>\n<p>a. 1:44; 6:11; Mt 10:18; Lu 9:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-10","title":"Mark 13:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>16:15; Mt 24:14; 28:18,19; Ro 1:8; 10:18; 15:19; Col 1:6,23; Re 14:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-11","title":"Mark 13:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>and deliver. 9; Mt 10:17,21; Ac 3:13 take. Ex 4:10-12; Jer 1:6-9; Da 3:16-18; Mt 10:19,20; Lu 12:11,12 Lu 21:14,15; Ac 2:4; 4:8-22,31; 6:10,15; 7:55 shall be. Isa 50:4; Joh 3:27; Eph 6:19,20; Jas 1:5 but. 2Sa 23:2; 1Co 2:13; Eph 3:5; 1Pe 1:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-12","title":"Mark 13:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Eze 38:21; Mic 7:4-6; Mt 10:21; 24:10; Lu 12:52,53; 21:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-13","title":"Mark 13:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>ye. Mt 5:11,12; 24:9; Lu 6:22; 21:17; Joh 15:18,19; 17:14; 1Jo 3:13 but. Da 12:12; Mt 10:22; 24:13; Ro 2:7; Ga 6:9; Heb 3:14; 10:39; Jas 1:12 Re 2:10; 3:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-14","title":"Mark 13:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>the abomination. Da 8:13; 9:27; 12:11; Mt 24:15-28; Lu 21:20-22 where. La 1:10; Eze 44:9 let him. Mt 13:51; Ac 8:30,31; 1Co 14:7,8,20; Re 1:3; 13:18 then. Lu 21:21-24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-15","title":"Mark 13:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>Ge 19:15-17,22,26; Job 2:4; Pr 6:4,5; 22:3; Mt 24:16-18 Lu 17:31-33; Ac 27:18,19,38; Php 3:7,8; Heb 11:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-17","title":"Mark 13:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>De 28:56,57; La 2:19,20; 4:3,4,10; Ho 9:14; 13:16; Mt 24:19-21 Lu 21:23; 23:29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-19","title":"Mark 13:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>in those. De 28:59; 29:22-28; Isa 65:12-15; La 1:12; 2:13; 4:6; Da 9:12,26 Da 12:1; Joe 2:2; Mt 24:21; Lu 21:22-24 from. De 4:32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-20","title":"Mark 13:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>for. Isa 1:9; 6:13; 65:8,9; Zec 13:8,9; Mt 24:22; Ro 11:5-7,23,24,28-32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-21","title":"Mark 13:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>De 13:1-3; Mt 24:5,23-25; Lu 17:23,24; 21:8; Joh 5:43</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-22","title":"Mark 13:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>if it. 6; Mt 24:24; Joh 10:27,28; 2Th 2:8-14; 2Ti 2:19; 1Jo 2:19,26 Re 13:8,13,14; 17:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-23","title":"Mark 13:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>take. 5,9,33; Mt 7:15; Lu 21:8,34; 2Pe 3:17 behold. Isa 44:7,8; Joh 14:29; 16:1-4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-24","title":"Mark 13:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>Isa 13:10; 24:20-23; Jer 4:23-25,28; Eze 32:7; Da 7:10; 12:1 Joe 2:30,31; Am 5:20; Zep 1:14-18; Mt 24:29-31; Lu 21:25-27 Ac 2:19,20; 2Pe 3:10,12; Re 6:12-14; 20:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-26","title":"Mark 13:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>8:38; 14:62; Da 7:9-14; Mt 16:17,27; 24:30; 25:31; Ac 1:11; 1Th 4:16 2Th 1:7-10; Re 1:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-27","title":"Mark 13:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>shall he. Mt 13:41,49; 24:31; Lu 16:22; Re 7:1-3; 15:6,7 shall gather. Ge 49:10; Mt 25:31,32; Joh 10:16; 11:52; 1Th 4:14-17; 2Th 2:1 Re 7:5-9 his elect. 20,22; Isa 65:9; Mt 24:22,24,31; Lu 18:7; Ro 8:33; Col 3:12 2Ti 2:10; 1Pe 1:2 from. De 30:4; Mt 12:42</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-28","title":"Mark 13:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>Mt 24:32,33; Lu 21:29-31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-29","title":"Mark 13:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>know. Eze 7:10-12; 12:25-28; Heb 10:25-37; Jas 5:9; 1Pe 4:17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-30","title":"Mark 13:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>that. Mt 16:28; 23:36; 24:34; Lu 21:32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-31","title":"Mark 13:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>Heaven. Ps 102:25-27; Isa 51:6; Mt 5:18; 24:35; Heb 1:10-12; 2Pe 3:10-12 Re 20:11 my. Nu 23:19; Jos 23:14,15; Ps 19:7; Isa 40:8; Zec 1:6; Lu 21:33 2Ti 2:13; Tit 1:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-32","title":"Mark 13:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>of. 26,27; Mt 24:36-42; 25:6,13,19; Ac 1:7; 1Th 5:2; 2Pe 3:10; Re 3:3 neither. Re 1:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-33","title":"Mark 13:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>23,35-37; 14:37,38; Mt 24:42-44; 25:13; 26:40,41; Lu 12:40; 21:34-36 Ro 13:11,12,14; 1Co 16:13; Eph 6:18; 1Th 5:5-8; Heb 12:15 1Pe 4:7; 5:8; Re 3:2; 16:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-34","title":"Mark 13:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>as a. Mt 24:45; 25:14-30; Lu 19:12-17 and to. Ro 12:4-8; 13:6; 1Co 3:5-10; 12:4-31; 15:58; Col 3:24; 4:1 and commanded. Eze 3:17-21; 33:2-9; Mt 24:45-47; Lu 12:36-40; Ac 20:29-31 the porter. Mt 16:19; Joh 10:3; Re 3:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-35","title":"Mark 13:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>33; Mt 24:42,44</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-36","title":"Mark 13:36","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":36,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":36},"content":"<p>he find. 14:37,40; Pr 6:9-11; 24:33,34; So 3:1; 5:2; Isa 56:10; Mt 24:48-51 Mt 25:5; Lu 21:34; 22:45; Ro 13:11-14; Eph 5:14; 1Th 5:6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-13-37","title":"Mark 13:37","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":37,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":37},"content":"<p>I say. 33,35; Lu 12:41-46</p>"}]}